    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu kuikaba Ethiopia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikirenyi mrumo ghwa mawawa ghuko kimonu cha meda ya Ethiopia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ethiopia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kutambua kwaro ni wushu ghwa chilu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef. 2.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijo isanga jaduma wadumi wake kwa chia ya Moda ghwa Naili, kwa kutumia mashua ribonyero na maria. Ghendenyi shwa-shwa inyo wadumwa, kwa iyo mbari ya wandu walacha widendere; mbari iobolwagha ni wandu kula na kaavui, mbari iwadie ndighi isimagha; isanga jake jiwaghilo ni meda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo wandu wose mkaiagha wurumwengunyi, inyo mmbose mkaiagha ndoenyi; bendera ikawusirwa mghondinyi mzighane, na tarumbeta ikakabwa msikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu BWANA wanizerie huwu, “Nichazighana mboaeri kufuma andu kwapo nikaiagha, sa ndoe yakombwa ingelo iruwa jakala, sa iwingu ja mami mrukenyi ngelo ekuwida viro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu imbiri ya kukuwida, iji vishekero vasia na zabibu kuwurwa, Mlungu uchanona Ethiopia seji mundu udumbuagha chonge ra midi na kurikumba noko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gharia rawo richasigharika mghondinyi rijigho ni nyonyi ngelo ya sumesu, na nyamandu ra isakenyi ngelo ya kwari.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, awo wandu walacha widendere wichareda manosi kwa BWANA wa majeshi; awo wandu wiobolwagha kula na kaavui; iyo mbari ya wandu wiwadie ndighi, isimagha, na isanga jake jiwaghilo ni meda, wichamredia manosi Mghondinyi ghwa Sioni, andu irina ja BWANA wa majeshi jitaswagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
